  "question": "What fast food restaurant are present within 50 kilometers when moving toward the Ohio State University at Mansfield, Mansfield, OH starting at North Olmsted Recreation Center, North Olmsted, OH?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-81.910184 41.423463)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-82.578229 40.79881)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'fast_food'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-81.910184 41.423463)',4326)::geography, 50000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-81.910184 41.423463)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
